        ],
        "name": "GenAI",
        "text": "WHAT THE F*CK. SpaceXAI is using Grok Bot to build Grok Bot. Its agents design, code, test, and ship the product.\n\nIn this 45-minute session, Peng Zheng and Lauren Tanshowed their internal setup across design, engineering, user feedback, and bot management.\n\nOne key frame becomes a complete Figma flow. One project gets split across four engineer bots. Repeated bug reports from X become fix proposals without anyone copying the context by hand.\n\nSome PRs merge before a human reads them. This talk alone replaces a $500 course on building AI agent teams.\n\nWatch it today, then read the article on building your own Grok Bot team from scratch below.",
